{
  "core_message": "A black bear died from a cocaine drop by smugglers.",
  "mood": "curious",
  "title": "175‑Pound Bear’s 75‑Pound Cocaine Overdose",
  "description": "A 175‑pound black bear met a bizarre end after a drug smuggler’s cargo fell from a plane.\n\nIn 1985, a Cessna released 40 plastic containers of cocaine over Tennessee, and a nearby bear ate the stash. The overdose killed the bear, which was later taxidermied and displayed in a Kentucky mall. The story inspired a 2023 film and documentary. The incident remains one of the strangest wildlife drug overdoses in history.\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"Cocaine Bear (bear)\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cocaine_Bear_(bear)), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.\n\nImages from Wikimedia Commons:\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall.jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall.jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nUSCGC Bear transfers cocaine in the Atlantic near Florida, Sept 2014.jpg (U.S. Department of Defense Current Photos, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USCGC_Bear_transfers_cocaine_in_the_Atlantic_near_Florida,_Sept_2014.jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nCGC Bear Cocaine Offload 110921-G-ZE884-024.jpg (Petty Officer 2nd Class Nick Ameen, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CGC_Bear_Cocaine_Offload_110921-G-ZE884-024.jpg\nCGC BEAR DVIDS1082493.jpg (Petty Officer 2nd Class Kip Wadlow, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CGC_BEAR_DVIDS1082493.jpg\n\n3D models:\nLight Aircraft by rhcreations (CC BY 4.0) https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/none-a8dd34a73737448f961d226734a3fc59",
